The [[Squirrel]] is a [[Pet]] available in the shop for [[Ranger]]s with [[Big Bowl of Treats]]. It steals buffs at a slow rate, although it is hastened by touching [[Pet]]s and [[Food]]. Combining the [[Squirrel]] with a [[Shortbow]] gives the [[Squirrel Archer]], which is a mostly superior damaging [[weapon]] [[pet]] version of the [[Squirrel]], that has a similar buff-stealing effect.
